# TradingView Fracture Threshold EMA Score

## Source
- Source: [[sources/tradingview-mechanical-strategy-scripts]]
- Page / Timestamp: TradingView script `Fracture Threshold Strategy [JOAT]`, author handle `officialjackofalltrades`, open-source strategy, accessed 2026-05-22, Apr 26, https://www.tradingview.com/script/NwMwuyA5-Fracture-Threshold-Strategy-JOAT/

## Mechanics

### Entry
Use M15 baseline on liquid DWX FX/index CFDs.

- Compute seven-condition MasterTrend bull/bear score:
  - EMA(4) above/below EMA(5).
  - RSI(14) above/below 50.
  - Close above/below EMA(21).
  - EMA(21) above/below SMA(50).
  - SMA(50) above/below EMA(55).
  - EMA(55) above/below EMA(89).
  - Close above/below EMA(750).
- Compute relative volume regime:
  - volRatio = EMA(short volume MA / long volume MA, smoothing length).
  - Default threshold: volRatio >= 0.90.
  - On DWX, use tick volume with the same formula.
- Session filter:
  - London 08:00-17:00.
  - New York 14:00-21:00.
- Long setup:
  - Bull MasterTrend score >= 5 of 7.
  - Volume regime passes.
  - Session is active.
  - EMA(4) crosses above EMA(5) on confirmed bar.
- Short setup:
  - Bear MasterTrend score >= 5 of 7.
  - Volume regime passes.
  - Session is active.
  - EMA(4) crosses below EMA(5) on confirmed bar.

### Exit
- Fixed take profit at 3.0R from initial stop distance.
- No trailing stop in baseline.
- Entry and exit orders execute on next bar open after confirmed signal.

### Stop Loss
- Initial stop = 1.5 * ATR(14) from entry.
- V5 spread guard: skip if spread > 15% of stop distance.

### Position Sizing
V5 default: fixed-risk $1,000 for P2 baseline, one position per symbol/magic. Source default says pyramiding 0.

### Zusatzliche Filter
- Require at least 750 warmup bars before taking signals because EMA(750) is part of the score.
- P3 can test minimum score 4/5/6 and volume gate on/off.

## Concepts (what kind of strategy is this)
- [[concepts/trend-following]] - trades fast EMA crossover only when the broader EMA stack and RSI agree.
- [[concepts/confluence-score]] - seven conditions produce bull/bear score.
- [[concepts/session-filter]] - London and New York windows gate entries.

